Git  :
Version control system
It allows developers to track about changes that are happening in the code files
We can collaborate with multiple developers without overwriting each others code
We can also return to the previous version whenever we want to do
(It was a commandline tool and Helps us to track the data)

Github  :
It was a cloud based platform for Hosting git repositories that we are creating in local environment

git init   - It can convert normal windows repository into local git repository
git add    - It adds the files and folders that are related to our project into the git local repository
git commit - It was used to save the files and folders in the local repository
git push   - It was used to push the origin folder(holds our entire project in single variable) into main folder

